    "detailed_description": "To begin your adventure in The Grindstone you need to form a team of 4.<br />\r\nYou first pick your race from human, elf, dark-elf, amzar, lizard-folk and other<br />\r\nvarious monsters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou then decide a class varying from a heavy armor wearing Warrior, a magic<br />\r\nthrowing Wizard, a Ranger covering the battle field with arrows and much more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou set off into the world with the freedom to take things how you please.<br />\r\nYou can help towns, or ignore all of them and just go work on your fishing<br />\r\nabilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere's a wide world to explore that's absolutely packed with monsters,<br />\r\ntreasure, and quests.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a single player RPG<br />\r\nPlayers can expect over 30 hours of gameplay<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Crafting/Alchemy/FIshing/Mining available<br />\r\n*Veteran Experience System<br />\r\n*Bosses respawn<br />\r\n*Dynamic Battle system",
